00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:46.520
They also covered post-mortem adult neurons and neurons differentiated in vitro,

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:50.280
so the same folding assay could be read in tissue and in culture.

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:55.040
factor. That comparison is how the team line stem cell derived neurons up against cells

00:00:55.040 --> 00:01:00.729
taken from developing and adult brains. Nickel ferrite particles with a barium-tightenate

00:01:00.729 --> 00:01:05.929
