00:01:05.929 --> 00:01:11.789
in nature biomedical engineering without a surgical implant. Under magnetic fields the core

00:01:11.789 --> 00:01:17.229
and shell generate electrical pulses that activate vagal afference. Those pulses raise

00:01:17.229 --> 00:01:22.469
noripinephrine in the locus serulius and increased dopamine synthesis in the substantioneigra.

00:01:23.129 --> 00:01:27.029
The same stimulation engages the colonergic anti-inflammatory pathway.

00:01:27.669 --> 00:01:32.749
In experimental Parkinson's models, the approach reduced motor symptoms and anxiety-like behavior.

00:01:33.982 --> 00:01:38.602
Staffalococcus aureus lingers indefinitely in some noses while other people never become

00:01:38.602 --> 00:01:44.242
