00:01:44.242 --> 00:01:46.722
rather than to a single pathogen acting alone.

00:01:47.402 --> 00:01:52.542
The work centers on interactions among resident bacterial species, instead of treating colonization

00:01:52.542 --> 00:01:54.882
as a property of S-Orius by itself.

